flowchart TD
  S[What do you need to undo?] --> W[Unstaged file edit]
  S --> I[Staged change]
  S --> L[Local commit not shared]
  S --> P[Published shared commit]
  W --> WR[git restore --worktree]
  I --> IR[git restore --staged to unstage]
  L --> LR[reset only after review; choose mode]
  P --> PR[git revert adds inverse commit]
  LR -. hard reset can discard work .-> C[Caution: preserve important edits]
